# .dockerignore — what the image build must NOT send to the daemon.
#
# The Dockerfile does `COPY . .` on purpose (the image IS the framework), so
# without this file the build context was the entire working tree: `.git`,
# `data/` (the operator's engagement state!), `tests/`, `electron/node_modules`,
# `build/`, `dist/`, `*.egg-info`. That is slow to upload, and the layers bake a
# copy of local state that has nothing to do with the image (the audit's §5.4).
#
# The image needs: phantom/ (code + payloads/exploits), setup.py, MANIFEST.in
# and requirements.txt. Everything below is either generated, local-only, or a
# language tree the image does not build.

# ── version control ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.git
.gitattributes
.gitignore
.gitlab-ci.yml
.github

# ── the operator's own state: never in an image ───────────────────────────
data/
.env
.env.*
*.env
!*.env.example
data/*.pm
*.pm
# Local credentials and engagement artefacts. The Dockerfile uses `COPY . .`,
# so a `.c2_token` or an OSINT/chat dump left in the working tree would land in
# the build context (and possibly an image layer) even though Git ignores it.
.c2_token
.c2_token.*
someuser.txt
comando.txt
.body.ps1
freebuff-chat-*.md

# ── build output / caches ──────────────────────────────────────────────────
build/
dist/
*.egg-info/
.eggs/
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/
*.log

# ── python envs ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.venv/
venv/
env/

# ── the Electron app: built and released on its own ───────────────────────
electron/
**/node_modules/

# ── tests and docs: contributors' material, not runtime ───────────────────
# (lab/ and scripts/ stay: they are small text, and the evolution/lab flow
# and the parity checks reference them from inside the tree.)
tests/
docs/

# ── cross-compiled artefacts (the image builds its own) ───────────────────
c2d/c2d
c2d/c2d.exe
phantom/payloads/**/*.exe
phantom/payloads/**/*.o
phantom/payloads/**/*.bin
phantom/payloads/remote/**/*.apk
phantom/payloads/**/build/

# ── editor / OS noise ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
